Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次把注意力回归到呼吸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, once more return your attention to the breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意你的呼吸会自然延续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notice how your breathing continues...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无需外力\N{\fnArial\fs30}all by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.09,0:00:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的思绪可能飘走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind may wander.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.47,0:01:03.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任它走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simply watch it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.26,0:01:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要评判\N{\fnArial\fs30}And without judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.65,0:01:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  你好快\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, that was so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.67,0:01:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你就停在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize you'd be parked right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是啊  刚下了客  - 那我走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, just dropped somebody off. - Oh, it's my lucky day then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去老街...你都知道了哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to Old Street... Oh, you've got the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.82,0:01:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那里工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you work in that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.65,0:02:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  想事呢  我没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, miles away, I didn't catch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那里工作吗  你上车的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that where you work, where I picked you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在生活碎片吗  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Smithereen? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:10.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是公事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒希望我在那里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I wish I worked there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的设施啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The facilities they've got in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.81,0:02:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有自己的水疗  简直了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've got their own spa. It's madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:20.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利·鲍尔就是有钱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Billy Bauer money for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.59,0:02:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.77,0:03:24.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我女儿叫克莉丝汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter's name was Kristin
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krissie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.97,0:03:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20岁  大学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty years old. She was at university.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她自杀了  自尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed herself, took her own life,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.03,0:03:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你怎么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you wanna call it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经18个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}18 months ago now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且很突然\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:44.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的一个室友打给的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of her flatmates called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在浴室里发现了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd found her in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好生她的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm furious with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好气她  不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so fucking angry with her for not telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:00.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为我知道...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I knew, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:04.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最后一次通话时  她还开开心心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I spoke, she was happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.13,0:04:11.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那样  她了结了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just like that, she ended everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道她为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know why she did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问过自己数百万遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've asked myself why a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为个男孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it over some boy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是因为课业  因为这世界  还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}or her course or the state of the world or me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.47,0:04:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it something I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题在我脑子里打转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Round and round in my head
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没有答案  什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's no answer, there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不能回答了  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not here to say, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这永远不会停下  这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's never gonna stop, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.45,0:04:40.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想知道的渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}needing to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不会停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才叫令人紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about nerve-racking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我第一次发言\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my first time speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:03.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当着大家说  他们真不好取悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, in front of everyone. Tough crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:05.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you did really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:10.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是第一次  这挺可怕的  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time, though, shit scary, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to be honest, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来之后还没见过你分享  你是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't spoken while I've been here. I mean, is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是还没找到合适的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just haven't found the right moment yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:20.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是在等合适的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for the right moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想去喝点东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you fancy a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明天还很多事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a bit of a long day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  明天可能就死了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Might die tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.98,0:05:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.64,0:05:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真需要那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想让你也爽到  - 待会儿的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna make you cum, too. - In a bit maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就是需要喘口气  - 都好久没做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just need a bit... bit of a breather. - It's been ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不记得上次是什么时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't even remember the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  你介意我...  - 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, do you mind if I...? - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这玩意很丢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know these things are undignified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概四个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went on a date
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟手机软件上认识的男人去约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}about four months back with a guy off an app.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一道菜吃到一半  我讲了克莉丝汀的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halfway through the starter, I tell him about Kristin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.55,0:06:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的反应好像我说我得了癌症似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He reacted like I said I'd got cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:40.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她室友寄给我的  本来放在她房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her flatmate sent that to me. It was in her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:49.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  好  稍等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Okay, give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:55.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想进入克莉丝汀的人际圈账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to get into Kristin's Persona account.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:07:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每天都尝试登陆  你可以猜错三次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try logging in every day. It gives you three wrong guesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就要被封几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}then locks you out for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次我想到个密码  就记在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I think of a guess, I write it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这周我在猜我们度过假的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This week I'm into places we went on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是她妈妈  按说他们该给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm her mum. You'd think they'd give me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我女儿账户的密码  但不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}the password to my own daughter's account, but, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,违反他们的隐私政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violates their privacy policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能证明自己是亲属  它们可以纪念账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll memorialize it if you prove you're next of kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.99,0:07:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,配上遗像  弄成黑白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes it sort of sepia with a tribute photo,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:23.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那样就会删除收件箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that deletes the inbox.
