Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.19,0:25:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我困在这儿了  我有枪  时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck here, I've got a fucking gun. There's not much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.72,0:25:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本不想这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to do it like this
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.75,0:25:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我需要马上跟比利·鲍尔通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need to speak to Bauer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.34,0:25:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.81,0:25:05.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.89,0:25:07.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是  - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.07,0:25:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像刚拍了张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he just took a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.21,0:25:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你收到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.83,0:25:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.42,0:25:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是你们的杰登吧  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's your guy Jaden, yeah? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.16,0:25:25.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.81,0:25:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你帮我接通比利·鲍尔的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get me Billy Bauer on the phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.36,0:25:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没人会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.03,0:25:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想跟比利·鲍尔  通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna speak with Billy Bauer on... on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.17,0:25:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我不知道怎么联系比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I don't know how to get to Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.16,0:25:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你可以想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.69,0:25:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我尽量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can try to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:40.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以保持通话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you stay on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.72,0:25:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.76,0:25:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会挂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.35,0:26:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定这不是恶作剧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure it's not a prank?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.70,0:26:02.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不能百分百确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be a hundred percent,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.81,0:26:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这是耍人玩的  我可不想打去美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't wanna call the US if this is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.27,0:26:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边还是一大早呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still bloody morning over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.99,0:26:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.21,0:26:26.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽姆  这对你来说也够早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maryam, this is early even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.56,0:26:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.64,0:26:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.27,0:26:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让唐和西奈尔10点去会议室见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have Don and Shonelle meet me in the boardroom in ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.87,0:27:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害的来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the hotstepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.79,0:27:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拉警戒线  - 走吧  孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get a cordon going. - Come on, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.60,0:27:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到人质了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get a look at the hostage yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.04,0:27:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  摘掉头套了  在后座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hood's off, he's in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.82,0:27:55.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他样子也就20出头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early twenties, by the looks of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.07,0:27:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是谈判专家大卫·吉尔克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is David Gilkes, negotiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.00,0:27:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有谁跟嫌疑人说过话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either of you speak to the suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.47,0:28:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就他掏枪时说了一两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}For like a second when he pulled the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.00,0:28:02.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看上去像是醉酒或嗑药了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seem pissed up? On something?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.91,0:28:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  就是很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.47,0:28:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们平和一下气氛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's cut back on the razzmatazz.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.88,0:28:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况是挺紧张  但最好别再搞出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's tense but we're not risking a shit storm
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.29,0:28:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特顿可怜的老发令枪先生那样的丑闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the whole Stretton thing with poor old Mr. Starter Pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.54,0:28:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 长官  - 我知道  但他根本没武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ma'am, I... - Yes, I know but he was unarmed
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.49,0:28:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且那才过去不到一个月  大家还没忘呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was less than a month ago. Memories aren't that short yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.29,0:28:24.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以除非别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So no critical shot
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.55,0:28:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要开致命枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless there's absolutely no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.81,0:28:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吗  - 是  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.22,0:28:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的鞋带开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lace is undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.16,0:28:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官  他们已查到了车辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, they've ID'd the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.87,0:28:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注册在埃莉诺·凯瑟琳·吉尔海尼名下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's registered to an Eleanor Kathleen Gillhaney,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.27,0:28:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,67岁  登记地址在伊维尔姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}sixty-seven years old, listed under an address in Ewelme.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.36,0:28:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那离这里就几英里吧  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's, what, couple of miles from here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.61,0:28:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我知道那里  - 好  你俩去敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know Ewelme. - Okay, you two go and give it a knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.94,0:28:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看她是否还好  - 是  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See if she's okay. - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.86,0:28:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官  我让这些车退开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, I'm gonna get these cars out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.29,0:28:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.02,0:29:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佩内  我们得告诉比利发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pen, we have to tell Billy what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.83,0:29:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这事以枪战收尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this thing ends in some kinda of a shoot-out,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.81,0:29:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他至少该知道情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}he should at least be aware of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.10,0:29:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有发现  - 他可能会开始提更多要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got a hit. - He could start making other demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.16,0:29:16.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 稍等  唐  怎么了  - 他用的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One moment, Don. What is it? - Okay, the cell he's calling from,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.01,0:29:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到处查了  有匹配\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran it through everything and got a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.97,0:29:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是登记在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's registered
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.66,0:29:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个账户下的两步验证号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a two-step verification number on this account.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.29,0:29:25.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调出我们能查到的他的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull out whatever we can get on this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.87,0:29:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在线上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still on hold, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.04,0:29:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他听播放列表呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him listening to a playlist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.12,0:29:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利·鲍尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Bauer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.03,0:29:50.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会为我付赎金的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he's not gonna pay a ransom on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.28,0:29:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他都不知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't even know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.27,0:30:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们确定是恐怖袭击了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they know if it's a terror thing yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.95,0:30:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没人知道情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.09,0:30:04.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还是回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.42,0:30:08.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 时间线都爆炸了  - 我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Timeline's going nuts. - Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.09,0:30:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 总控  黑人人质  - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Control, IC3 hostage... - Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.06,0:30:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道人质身份了  生活碎片的员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know who the hostage is. He's from Smithereen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.66,0:30:17.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个什么社交公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}The social whatever company?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.45,0:30:18.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  他们联系了伦敦警察厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They contacted the Met
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.94,0:30:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说他们的一位实习生被持械劫持\N{\fnArial\fs30}to say one of their interns is being held at gunpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.88,0:30:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰登·汤明斯  枪手还发了照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaden Tommins. The gunman sent a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.85,0:30:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是被派去办事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd been sent on an errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.21,0:30:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们用手机软件搭车客叫了辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}They booked a cab through the Hitcher app.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.75,0:30:34.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在可不在出租车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not in a cab now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联系搭车客  查询司机信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Hitcher, get what we can on the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.92,0:30:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们知道发照片的号码吗  - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got the number that sent that photo? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.60,0:30:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让情报部查下通话数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run the call data through intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.02,0:30:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对他们说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.01,0:30:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他说名字了吗  - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he give a name? - No name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.03,0:30:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么都不肯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't tell them anything
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.04,0:30:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他说他要跟比利·鲍尔通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he did say he needs to speak to Billy Bauer on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.13,0:30:49.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那个比利·鲍尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Bauer as in Billy Bauer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.65,0:30:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.28,0:31:01.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是生活碎片的佩内洛普·吴\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Penelope Wu from Smithereen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.24,0:31:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你要求跟鲍尔先生通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you've asked to speak with Mr. Bauer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.64,0:31:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  你们接通比利·鲍尔了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. So have you got Billy Bauer on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.39,0:31:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 抱歉  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Sorry. Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.87,0:31:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经在尽全力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.35,0:31:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以跟杰登说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I speak to Jaden?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.25,0:31:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他没事  - 我想确认他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's fine. - I just need to check he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.72,0:31:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 告诉他们你没事  - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell them you're okay. - Uh, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.18,0:31:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了吧  你们最好赶紧让比利·鲍尔听电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. So you'd better hurry up and get Billy Bauer on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他所在的地方时间还早\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still very early where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.44,0:31:28.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们联系不上他  - 那我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're having difficulty reaching him. - That's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.97,0:31:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那现在  你可以大致说下这是为了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, meantime could you maybe outline what this is regarding?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.71,0:31:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我只跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm only speaking to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.30,0:31:37.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  但...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.86,0:31:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是首席运营官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually the COO.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.89,0:31:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.26,0:31:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样或许更快  如果我能告诉他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it might be quicker if I can present him with a...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.18,0:31:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上接通比利·鲍尔的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fucking get Billy Bauer on the phone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.59,0:31:48.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fucking around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.11,0:31:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会崩掉他的脑袋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will blow his fucking head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.38,0:31:52.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你明白吗  - 抱歉  当然  我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you understand? - I'm sorry, of course, I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.45,0:31:53.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让你继续待机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put you back on hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.79,0:31:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证  我们在想办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you we are working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.67,0:31:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be long!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.76,0:32:03.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他状态可不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's not stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.10,0:32:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说啊  唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what way, Don?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.62,0:32:06.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.58,0:32:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那音乐对他没什么帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that music helped him any.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.04,0:32:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我切换了线路  这样他在听歌时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I switched the line so now while he's hearing that,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.29,0:32:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以听到他那边的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can listen in to see what's happening at his end.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.38,0:32:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就他妈糊弄我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking messing me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.81,0:32:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.42,0:32:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last day. This is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.65,0:32:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last day. This is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.55,0:32:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后一天  这是我最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last day. This is my last day. This is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.49,0:32:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后一天  这是我最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last day. This is my last day. This is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.84,0:32:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.65,0:32:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last day. This is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.38,0:32:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃莉诺  吉尔海尼太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleanor? Mrs. Gillhaney?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.35,0:32:58.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.71,0:33:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.49,0:33:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗  埃莉诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Eleanor?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.37,0:33:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃莉诺  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleanor, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.18,0:33:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉尔海尼太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Gillhaney?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.69,0:33:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉尔海尼太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Gillhaney?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.53,0:33:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好像没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think anyone's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.94,0:33:25.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是个怪胎  - 纳杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got a weird one here. - Naj.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.81,0:33:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking hell, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是疯狂  看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, this is mad, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.34,0:33:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.05,0:33:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.06,0:33:59.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我们在找埃莉诺·吉尔海尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're looking for an Eleanor Gillhaney.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.06,0:34:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.90,0:34:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她三月份死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She, uh, died in March.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.58,0:34:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  各位  等待指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, stand by for instruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.19,0:34:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是她儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.26,0:34:40.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯  克里斯托弗  她死后他就搬了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris, Christopher. He moved in when she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.85,0:34:42.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, couple of months at any rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.61,0:34:44.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 自己住吗  - 他独来独往的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On his own? - Yeah, keeps to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.04,0:34:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天早上开车去上班  好像是在伦敦工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drives to work each morning, think he works somewhere in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.53,0:34:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has something happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.40,0:34:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已确认嫌疑人身份  克里斯托弗·吉尔海尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a positive ID on the suspect. Name's Christopher Gillhaney.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.78,0:34:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他似乎住在过世母亲的家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to be staying at his late mum's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.95,0:35:00.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一堆欠付账单  房子也要被收回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of red bills, and it's up for repossession.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.63,0:35:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嫌疑人情况呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you got on the suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.18,0:35:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原是教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Former teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.28,0:35:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  他是个教师  - 曾经是  教IT的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry? He's a teacher? - Well, he was a teacher. IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.26,0:35:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已被登记为失业两年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been registered unemployed going on two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.90,0:35:13.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 案底呢  - 查了所有记录  清清白白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's his record? - Fully DBS checked, he's squeaky clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.17,0:35:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的结果是作为受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only place he shows up is as a victim
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.87,0:35:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2015年11月的一起交通事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a road traffic accident, November 2015.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.02,0:35:20.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酒驾司机撞到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drunk driver plowed right into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.89,0:35:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括酒驾司机在内  两人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two dead, including the drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.85,0:35:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  干得漂亮  纳杰玛  - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, good work, Najma. - Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.67,0:35:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师会有真枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teacher with a real gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.68,0:35:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是没有可能  但也不大可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not impossible, but not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.71,0:35:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官  联调局找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, it's the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.77,0:35:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 联调局  紧急电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's the FBI. Urgent call.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.50,0:35:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是格蕾丝总警司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Superintendent Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.83,0:35:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  总警司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Chief Superintendent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.83,0:35:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是联调局的厄内斯托·克鲁兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Ernesto Cruz from the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.68,0:35:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  抱歉  请问你有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Sorry, what's this regarding?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.57,0:35:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在和硅谷的生活碎片联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're liaising with Smithereen, Silicon Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.62,0:35:53.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也在电话上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're also on this call.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.29,0:35:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  他们也在电话上\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, they're on the line as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.15,0:35:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  你好  我是生活碎片的佩内洛普·吴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, hi, this is Penelope Wu from Smithereen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.65,0:36:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我在一起的还有法务部的唐和分析部的西奈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me is Don from legal and Shonelle from analytics.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是谈判专家大卫·吉尔克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}David Gilkes, negotiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.66,0:36:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  吴女士  我们已经查明了嫌疑人的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Ms. Wu, we've identified the suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.38,0:36:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗·迈克尔·吉尔海尼  之前是名教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christopher Michael Gillhaney, former schoolteacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.93,0:36:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,33岁  他在生活碎片有档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}thirty-three years old. He has a Smithereen profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.24,0:36:14.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  - 首先  克里斯托弗的电话在待机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - So first off, Christopher's on hold
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.98,0:36:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们可以听到他的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we are able to listen in to his end of the line
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.03,0:36:19.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们都能听到通话内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we'll share live feed of that with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.33,0:36:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.92,0:36:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外  我们可以提供他在本公司留下的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}In addition, we figure we could share the data we have on him
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.58,0:36:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以协助你们那边的谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}to assist negotiations at your end,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.52,0:36:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但或许你们可以先告诉我们 \N{\fnArial\fs30}but first, perhaps you could share with us
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.21,0:36:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么看待他的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}your perception of what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是想勒索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably extortion,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.79,0:36:33.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于是不是针对贵公司  这我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether it's targeted at your company is something we don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.25,0:36:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对是针对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's targeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.52,0:36:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说什么  - 我们正在调查克里斯托弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry? - We're looking into who Christopher is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.12,0:36:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把他归为高智商  低收入人群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Group-wise we'd slot him into high intellect, low income.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.59,0:36:42.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通常都很愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Often angry people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.98,0:36:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我们查了他是否\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, well, we checked to see if he'd ever
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.07,0:36:47.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾对生活碎片整体表示过敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}expressed hostile sentiments towards Smithereen as an entity
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.90,0:36:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他的社交媒体中并无此表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing shows up on his social.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.14,0:36:52.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上  他的社交媒体已经空白一阵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, there's been nothing there at all for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.42,0:36:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的账户毫无活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}His whole account is dormant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.08,0:36:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白这有什么关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see how this is relevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.73,0:36:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但之后我们问了搭车客那边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then we checked in with the Hitcher guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.22,0:37:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  - 他接走杰登的那辆出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - So the cab that picked Jaden up
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.51,0:37:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是登记在奥马尔·马西姆巴鲁名下\N{\fnArial\fs30}is registered to an Omar Masimbalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.48,0:37:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你也会认同\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a name like that, I think you'll agree,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.54,0:37:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这并不是吉尔海尼先生的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}does not exactly match Mr. Gillhaney.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.03,0:37:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 原来这是个被泄露的账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Turns out it was a compromised account.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.38,0:37:12.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人们在暗网上出售\N{\fnArial\fs30}People trade them on the dark web.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.74,0:37:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯应该是通过那种方式获得了这个账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems likely Chris got a hold of it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.76,0:37:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You appreciate what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.16,0:37:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直在掩盖自己的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been covering his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.46,0:37:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我们请求搭车客告知我们他的账户情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we asked Hitcher to share his account activity
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.67,0:37:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去几周以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it seems for weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.64,0:37:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他都只接\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd been only accepting jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.56,0:37:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦敦生活碎片外的乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}specifically outside the Smithereen London address.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.20,0:37:36.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都停在公司外等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just parked up each day waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.93,0:37:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到他接到一位这间公司的员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}until he got a job from someone inside the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.63,0:37:42.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已计划良久\N{\fnArial\fs30}This... This is a whole plan he's had going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.46,0:37:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一种专业的犯罪行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is sophisticated criminal behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.31,0:37:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很难相信他之前没有犯过罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it hard to believe he's never raised red flags before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.24,0:37:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他完全没有案底\N{\fnArial\fs30}His record's totally clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.10,0:37:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他之前曾是受害者...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he was the victim in...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.49,0:37:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2015年的车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The auto accident in 2015.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.97,0:37:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在这场车祸中失去了未婚妻  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost his fiancée in that crash. Were you aware of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.02,0:38:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.06,0:38:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.08,0:38:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在自己的主页上发过贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were historical posts inside his network,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.53,0:38:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吊唁  纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}condolences, memorials,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.32,0:38:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上  克里斯就是那时脱离社交媒体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's when Chris disengages, in fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.29,0:38:12.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再和朋友联系  虽然他表现出了悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}not interacting with friends even though he's expressing grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.63,0:38:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经做足了功课\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.86,0:38:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  我觉得这不是为了钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm thinking this isn't about money.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.71,0:38:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大卫  - 请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- David. - Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.89,0:38:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯和鲍尔年纪相仿  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris is about the same age as Bauer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.21,0:38:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都有极客背景  对电脑很熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've both got geeky backgrounds, computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.19,0:38:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大卫  - 或许连克里斯自己都觉得是为了钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- David. - Maybe even Chris thinks it's about money
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.13,0:38:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实是为了地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's actually about status.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.25,0:38:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍尔有钱  有权  受人尊敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bauer's got money, power, respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.95,0:38:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但克里斯托弗有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Christopher got?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.08,0:38:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个穷光蛋  开着出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's skint. He's driving a hookie cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.12,0:38:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他失去了未婚妻  还有妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just lost his fiancée, his mum as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.51,0:38:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是克里斯托弗觉得他想要鲍尔所拥有的一切呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Christopher thinks he wants what Bauer's got?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.98,0:38:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他真正的目的只是引起他的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But really, it's just about getting his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.37,0:38:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是这样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if that's what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.70,0:38:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这能帮你说服他下车来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that gonna help you talk him out of that car?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.58,0:38:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他肯听我说  能\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he'll listen to me, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.28,0:39:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christopher!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.00,0:39:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  克里斯托弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Christopher?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.14,0:39:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗  我叫大卫·吉尔克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christopher, my name is David Gilkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.49,0:39:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是大卫  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm David, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.62,0:39:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能看见的话  我就是那个在挥手的傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can see me, I'm the berk waving his arm in the air, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.71,0:39:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿着廉价西装的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one in the cheap suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.62,0:39:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  这里有很多警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, there's a whole load of police here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.64,0:39:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说  他们只是在做自己的本职工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to be honest, they're just doing their jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.51,0:39:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得他们担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think they're worried
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.42,0:39:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会伤到自己或其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna hurt yourself or someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.92,0:39:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你不会这么做的  克里斯托弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you will, Christopher,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.48,0:39:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不确定他们会不会这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not sure that they think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.73,0:39:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他们什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.93,0:39:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯  是我打来的  克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris, that's me calling you, Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.31,0:39:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.70,0:39:54.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想跟你聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna talk to you for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.01,0:39:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈里斯  如果需要  你能一枪击中吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harris, if we need you, you got a clear shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.53,0:40:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还不能  人质就在枪手正后方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clear shot yet. Hostage is directly behind the gunman.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.30,0:40:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能闭嘴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you shut up, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.18,0:40:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  把那个递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick. Can you hand me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.54,0:40:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯  我知道你现在压力很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris, I know you're pretty stressed at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.79,0:40:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是谈判专家吗  - 我叫大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you the negotiator? - My name is David...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.45,0:40:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢了  大卫  你是谈判专家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for that, David. Are you the negotiator?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.29,0:40:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人这么叫我  但我只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, some people call me that, but really I'm just a...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.41,0:40:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我读过谈判专家的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read up about negotiators.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.93,0:40:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会假装是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll pretend to be my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.14,0:40:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后会慢慢尝试劝我投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you'll slowly try to convince me to give myself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.36,0:40:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯  你显然是个聪明人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris, you're obviously a smart guy
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.04,0:40:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就不废话...\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I won't bullsh...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.72,0:40:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果平和的说服没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if gentle persuasion doesn't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.95,0:40:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会打电话分散我的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll keep me distracted on the phone
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.39,0:40:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到你们的狙击手能一枪爆我头\N{\fnArial\fs30}long enough for one of your snipers to get a good head shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.97,0:40:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样吗  大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right, David?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.69,0:40:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  咱们别...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, let's just try to...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.65,0:40:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, let's just you fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.15,0:40:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧挂断  我在等比利·鲍尔的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the line. I'm waiting for Billy Bauer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.53,0:40:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是那个穿廉价西装的人  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you're the guy in the cheap suit, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.64,0:40:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是这么说的  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what you said? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.52,0:40:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  接下来这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so here's what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.11,0:40:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会数到一百\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna count to a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.41,0:40:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克里斯  - 好  那我数到五十\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chris. - Okay. I'm gonna count to 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.53,0:41:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我没看到你上车  马上滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't see you get in your car and fuck off right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.19,0:41:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就把他崩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll blow his fucking head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.79,0:41:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克里斯  没必要这样  - 一  二...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chris, we don't need to do like that. - One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.73,0:41:09.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈里斯  能一枪命中吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harris, have you got a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.23,0:41:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  如果我开枪  - 四\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, if I shoot, - ...four,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.22,0:41:11.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们都得死  - 五\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll kill them both. - five...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.14,0:41:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 六  七  八  九  - 他在虚张声势\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ...six, seven, eight, nine... - He's bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.39,0:41:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫  我们不能冒险  你清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, we can't risk it. You know we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.04,0:41:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把他脑袋崩开花  12  13\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will blow his fucking head off. 12, 13,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.29,0:41:24.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 14  - 快换个位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 14... - Fucking shift then.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.56,0:41:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15  16\N{\fnArial\fs30}...15, 16...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.55,0:41:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫  我命令你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, I'm ordering you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.18,0:41:31.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,17  18  19  20\N{\fnArial\fs30}...17, 18, 19, 20...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.21,0:41:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 钥匙  钥匙在谁那儿呢  - 21\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keys. Who's got the fucking keys?! - ...21,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.17,0:41:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22  23  24\N{\fnArial\fs30}22, 23, 24,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.50,0:41:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 25  26  - 就这样  继续动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 25, 26... - That's it, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.14,0:41:43.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让我能开枪  - 27  28  29  30\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me a clear shot. - ...27, 28, 29, 30,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.65,0:41:45.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 31  32  - 克里斯  他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 31, 32. - Chris, he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.82,0:41:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他走了  - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gone. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.48,0:41:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能打通电话  就没人会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one gets hurt if I get my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.34,0:41:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再打这个号码了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call this number again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.76,0:41:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别乱动了  - 抱歉  我抽筋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop shifting about. - Sorry, I've got cramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.23,0:42:01.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.20,0:42:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我收到英国警方的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hearing from the British cops
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.85,0:42:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没和谈判专家交涉成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's failed to engage with their negotiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.33,0:42:09.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科鲁兹探员  你能让我们商量下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Cruz, could you give us a moment please?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.41,0:42:12.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.36,0:42:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须告诉比利发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to tell Billy what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.00,0:42:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利不在  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy's not here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.63,0:42:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能就这样给他打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just call him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.68,0:42:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.49,0:42:27.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在进行十天的静默修行  现在第六天\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's six days into a ten-day silent retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.98,0:42:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 静默修行  - 就他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A silent retreat? - Just him alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.19,0:42:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不跟任何人讲话  与世隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}not speaking to anyone, total isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.11,0:42:35.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他周末时不时做过排毒  但这可是十天\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's done tech detox weekends here and there, but ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.69,0:42:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很不想掺和这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm very reluctant to step into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.18,0:42:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你知道他在哪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do know where he is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.74,0:42:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不知道我知道  但我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he doesn't know it but of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.06,0:43:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bauer?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.80,0:43:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.26,0:43:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.36,0:43:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bauer?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.69,0:44:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry to interrupt
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.11,0:44:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有件事你得知道一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's a situation you need to know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.51,0:44:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英国有个人把我们的一名实习生劫持了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone in the United kingdom has taken one of our interns hostage
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.53,0:44:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还威胁要杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're threatening to kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.48,0:44:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你能跟他通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless they can speak to you on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.56,0:44:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.63,0:44:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他差点撞上我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he nearly hit us and then,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.34,0:44:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后他就冲进那边的田地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he just crashed into that field over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.28,0:44:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那时他们喊道  "有枪"\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when they shouted, "Gun."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.12,0:44:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后  女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back, ladies and gents.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.98,0:45:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚登录了  此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just logged in. Like, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.44,0:45:05.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.49,0:45:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像在看现场围观群众的推文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he's looking at posts from bystanders at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.80,0:45:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.28,0:45:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.12,0:45:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有女友了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.28,0:45:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者男友  伴侣  什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a boyfriend? Partner? Whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.70,0:45:38.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.70,0:46:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你自首  他们可能网开一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you give yourself in, they might go easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.14,0:46:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.89,0:46:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.80,0:46:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.64,0:46:22.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.44,0:46:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想跟那个人通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna talk to the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.48,0:46:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a good idea.
