Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.82,0:54:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要你听我说  - 我在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want you to listen to me! - I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.09,0:54:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要...炸毛  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just not... blow up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.07,0:54:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们  冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just, you know, be calm
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.24,0:54:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就告诉我  你到底要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll just kind of tell me what it is that you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.34,0:54:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚和你说了  我要你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just told you. I want you to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.09,0:54:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好好听我说  - 我在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just fucking listen to me. - I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.46,0:54:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里没有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.64,0:54:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗  克里斯  只有你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Chris? It's just... it's you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.51,0:54:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在仔细听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.47,0:54:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克里斯  - 嗯  我只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chris? - Yeah, I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.97,0:54:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是...有点难理清楚我的思路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just... it's hard to get my thoughts in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.46,0:54:52.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经演练过了  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've rehearsed this though, and I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.44,0:54:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  慢慢来  你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. Take your time, man. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.07,0:54:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.12,0:54:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你运作生活碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run Smithereen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.99,0:55:02.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从2008年起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since 2008.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.08,0:55:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前总用生活碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to use Smithereen all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.40,0:55:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧  - 一刻不停那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - I mean, constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.14,0:55:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手机简直是黏在我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, my phone was glued to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.84,0:55:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是那种典型的网瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the whole cliché, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.90,0:55:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上睁眼就看手机  晚上睡前也在看手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}first thing I saw in the morning, last thing I saw at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.30,0:55:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔姆辛...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamsin was...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.36,0:55:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯  我在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris? I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.91,0:55:35.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔姆辛也一样  她是我未婚妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamsin was the same. She was my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.32,0:55:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.68,0:55:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和她一起开车回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was driving home with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.81,0:55:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看了我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd been visiting my mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.15,0:55:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈病了  我们去看了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mum was sick and we'd been visiting my mum
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.43,0:55:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时正开车载着塔姆辛回我们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was driving Tamsin back to our flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.43,0:55:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她当时睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.19,0:56:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她累了  我就开车带她回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was tired and I'm just driving her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.17,0:56:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上很无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.62,0:56:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.98,0:56:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时可能每过十秒就会觉得无聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got bored every ten seconds back then, I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.01,0:56:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在一条路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm on this A road.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.06,0:56:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四周非常安静  道路笔直\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was very quiet, straight...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.06,0:56:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手机突然亮了  我就打开看\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and my phone lights up and I check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.42,0:56:30.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就看了一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just glanced at it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.81,0:56:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一条通知\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this little notification thing
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.90,0:56:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人赞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}saying someone liked a comment
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.25,0:56:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对他们照片的评论\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I made about some photo of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.90,0:56:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就看了一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just glanced at it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.61,0:56:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那么短短的一瞬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all the time it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.15,0:57:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她挣扎了两个月才死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took her two months to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.27,0:57:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直陪在她床边  没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at her bedside. It was no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.56,0:57:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一辆车里的那个男人也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man in the other car died, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.37,0:57:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他喝醉了  他全责  他们说都是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was drunk. He got the blame. They said it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.13,0:57:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都很同情我  不幸先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone felt sorry for me. Mr. Tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.63,0:57:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连她父母也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.02,0:57:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在她的葬礼上  她母亲还安慰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}At her funeral, you know, her mum was comforting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.27,0:57:41.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her fucking mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.37,0:57:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么和她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could I say to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.82,0:57:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人想知道自己女儿的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wants to hear that their daughter's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.96,0:57:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为我在看手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I was looking at me fucking phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.21,0:57:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来  所有人都让我去接受悲伤疏导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afterwards, everyone tried to get me to go to grief counseling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.26,0:57:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是佩内  - 要我好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Pen. - Talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.79,0:57:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说出...我的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say... say how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.62,0:58:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.56,0:58:07.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都说不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say a fucking thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.98,0:58:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我的感受就是  是我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because how I feel is that I fucking killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.37,0:58:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.95,0:58:22.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.08,0:58:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为一张狗的照片...杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her over a fucking... dog photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.09,0:58:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就为那个害死了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.58,0:58:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.06,0:58:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.47,0:58:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.89,0:58:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我明白 在听"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I hear you."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.34,0:58:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当然在听我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you fucking hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.29,0:58:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听起来很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like you're in a lot of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.87,0:58:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊  说点人话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus fucking Christ! Speak like a fucking human being!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.89,0:59:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你在听  那你就好好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you hear me so fucking hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.73,0:59:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Okay? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.04,0:59:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们给了我一些扯淡的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave me bullshit advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.67,0:59:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么谈话要点  - 谈话要点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fucking talking points. - Talking points.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.09,0:59:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 该死的  - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fucking hell. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.81,0:59:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.97,0:59:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么和你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.05,0:59:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.23,0:59:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.31,0:59:31.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该说什么  我不知道你想让我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say. I don't know what you want me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.85,0:59:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.44,0:59:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我  开车的是我  是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me. I was driving. It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.86,0:59:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来没有和任何人说过  因为那有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told anyone before because what good would that do,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.80,0:59:43.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者我可以写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I could write it all down
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.54,0:59:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留遗言  自尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave a... A note, shoot myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.15,0:59:48.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那又有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what good would that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.85,0:59:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我想我能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought I could tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.36,0:59:53.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能让你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could get you to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.51,0:59:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你的东西  你创建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was your thing, you built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.87,1:00:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说你是故意开发成那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that that you make these things that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.83,1:00:03.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令人上瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Addictive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.40,1:00:07.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人根本移不开目光\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that you can't take your eyes off them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.37,1:00:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, job done.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.56,1:00:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是我的用户反馈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of user feedback for you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.69,1:00:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下一次更新时考虑进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe factor that into your next update.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.63,1:00:24.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你未婚妻的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry about your girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.75,1:00:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly. I'm, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.94,1:00:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来不该是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't supposed to be like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.09,1:00:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的整个平台  我对天发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our whole platform, I swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.58,1:00:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我创建的时候是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was... like, it was one thing when I started it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.12,1:00:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来就  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it just... I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.53,1:00:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来就变成了另一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it just became this whole other fucking thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.41,1:00:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是逐渐改变的  他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it got there by degrees, you know, they said...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.03,1:00:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"比利  你必须不断优化\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bill, you gotta keep optimizing,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.46,1:00:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住人们的注意力"\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta keep people engaged."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.49,1:00:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到它变得更像一根吸毒管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until it was more like a crack pipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.74,1:01:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像拉斯维加斯赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like some kind of fucking Vegas casino where...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.66,1:01:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我们把所有的门都焊死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'd sealed off all the fucking doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.67,1:01:05.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有一个部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got a department...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.70,1:01:07.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的工作就是故意调整成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All they do is tweak it like that on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.44,1:01:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们专攻你的多巴胺\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got dopamine targets
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.83,1:01:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我什么也阻止不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's nothing I can do to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.52,1:01:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我创建的  可我什么也阻止不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started it. There's nothing I can do to fucking stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.05,1:01:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在就像是  扯淡的幌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm like some kind of... fucking bullshit front-man now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.40,1:01:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对天发誓  我来这里静修\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, I've been on this retreat,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.70,1:01:25.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本应该是十天的\N{\fnArial\fs30}supposed to be for ten days...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.89,1:01:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果才过了两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}After, like, day two,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.54,1:01:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就决定  去它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided, fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.42,1:01:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我退出生活碎片  到此为止  我不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I quit Smithereen. That's it, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.96,1:01:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.48,1:01:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我绝不...  - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way I'm... - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.74,1:01:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不在乎你现在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a fuck what you do now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.87,1:01:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自弃  或者庆祝胜利  我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat yourself up or fucking run a victory lap, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.08,1:01:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想把我的想法说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to say my piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.42,1:01:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.30,1:01:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.27,1:01:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会放了我们的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gonna let our guy go?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.96,1:01:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然会  - 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course I am. - Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.05,1:02:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的  我本就是这么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to. I always was, all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.49,1:02:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我要离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.66,1:02:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  克里斯  离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Chris, um, out of here
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.07,1:02:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 意思是...  - 意思是离开这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}- as in... - As in out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.26,1:02:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不然你以为是什么意思  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think I fucking mean? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.35,1:02:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  什么  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what? Don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.09,1:02:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.91,1:02:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯  你不非得那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris, you do not have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.50,1:02:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能活下去  我害死了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stay here, not after what I did to her.
