Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.74,1:02:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必浪费你的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to waste your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.91,1:02:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经浪费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is wasted.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.69,1:02:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有什么我能做的  克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's anything that I can do, Chris,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.04,1:02:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得给我个机会  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta give me a shot here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.91,1:02:43.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有什么我能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be something that I can do,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.48,1:02:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕是一件小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if it's something small.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.40,1:02:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有一件我能帮你做的小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be one small thing that I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.81,1:02:51.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了  克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Chris, just...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.55,1:02:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯  任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris, anything.
