Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.33,1:03:27.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  - 是海莉·布莱克伍德吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Hayley Blackwood?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.59,1:03:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.01,1:03:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是旧金山的人际圈总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling from Persona in San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.63,1:03:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人让我把一些信息告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been asked to pass on some information to you.
