Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.84,1:03:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和他谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's spoken to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.72,1:04:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在放你走了  杰登  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna let you go now, Jaden. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.97,1:04:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.44,1:04:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.25,1:04:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心  小心  动作别太突然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, careful. No sudden movements now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.05,1:04:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不想吓到他们  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't wanna spook them, okay?
