Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.90,1:04:26.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cutting him free.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.23,1:04:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉让你经历这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for putting you through all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.99,1:04:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.87,1:05:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  快点  还磨蹭什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, what's taking...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.22,1:05:12.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别自杀  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kill yourself, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.71,1:05:20.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的  我舅舅自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, my uncle killed hisself
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.24,1:05:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我们全家都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it fucked my whole family up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.20,1:05:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈现在还很难过  我现在就出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mum's still a mess. I'll go out there right now
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.68,1:05:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我会告诉他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'll tell all of them,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.18,1:05:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会告诉他们你没伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell them that you didn't hurt me.
