Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.46,1:05:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.42,1:05:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下不了车  你没解除童锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get out the car, you left the child lock on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.33,1:06:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不  拜托  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. Please, don't.
